{"id":"basf-nz","name":"BASF Crop Solutions New Zealand","url":"https://crop-solutions.basf.co.nz/sitemap.xml","coverage":"The 28 crop products on the NZ site on the retrieval date. BASF Pest Control products (urban pests, rodent baits) are left out.","retrieved_on":"2026-11-07","notes":"ACVM number, actives, formulation, label and SDS links from each product page."},
