{"id":"corteva-nz","name":"Corteva Agriscience NZ crop protection","url":"https://www.corteva.com/nz/sitemap.html","coverage":"The 27 crop-protection products on the NZ sitemap on the retrieval date.","retrieved_on":"2026-11-02","notes":"Technical specifications from each product page. Formulation is blank where the page does not give it. Korvetto concentrations are not on its page."},
